 says he {Ayers} engaged in detestable acts 40 years ago.]  [April 16, Senator Hillary CLINTON&nbsp- says the Republicans will raise this issue.]  [On Thursday, McCAIN&nbsp- jokes about taking the gloves off.]  [Republican strategist Ken KHACHIGIAN&#134;- outlines what McCain has to do.]  \n\n(Studio: Dan Harris)  Live discussion held with \"Time\" magazine's Mark Halperin about the presidential election campaign.  [HALPERIN&nbsp- says Obama has surged head in electoral votes; outlines what McCain would have to do for a comeback.]  \n\n(Studio: Dan Harris)  The coming \"World News\" bus tour of the battleground states noted. ", "segment_duration": 460, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63060.0", "legacy_segment_id": 914298, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "06Jc346Ckf", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-05", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1700, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 914297, "segment_id": "TtQlQDt05w", "segment_broadcast_id": "06Jc346Ckf", "segment_title": "Economy: Bailout Bill", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Harris)  Report introduced.   (Studio: Bianna Golodryga)  The government's plans for implementing the 700 billion rescue/bailout plan previewed; details given about the bidding war over Wachovia bank and about billionaire Warren Buffett's supportive investments.  [Former Treasury Secretary Larry SUMMERS&#134;- says he will be watching what is happening in the financial sector, but these problems were made over a long time; suggests job destruction won't stop soon and policy has been behind the curve.] ", "segment_duration": 170, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63520.0", "legacy_segmen